The Technitium DNS Server API client in packages/technitium is generated from the structure of
Technitium DNS Server's API documentation (APIDOCS.md) and the request handlers in its server
source (DnsServerCore), release v15.5.0 (Copyright Shreyas Zare, GPL-3.0). This
repository contains only structural interface information derived from them: paths, permission
names, parameter and member names, types, enum values and section headings. It contains no
Technitium documentation text and no Technitium source code. The documentation and source files
are downloaded and verified at build time and are not redistributed.
